==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*200 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Angelic Devil's Japanese name, Oni wa Soto, Fuku wa Uchi (鬼は外、福は内, "Demons Out, Fortune In") is a chant said during ''mamemaki'', the main ritual of the Japanese holiday ''[[wikipedia:Setsubun|Setsubun]]''. This ritual involves throwing roasted soybeans at [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|someone]] wearing an ''[[wikipedia:Oni|oni]]'' (demon) mask while shouting "oni wa soto, fuku wa uchi!"

